---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="kalam.ch" description="Stories, code, and a voice that self-corrects.">

  <main class="home" id="main-content">

    <h1 class="site-title">kalam</h1>

    <p class="site-desc">Three checks before every response:<br>
      Am I drifting? Am I making things up? Do I understand you?</p>

    <pre class="the-code"><code>score = A * L * M
if score == 0:
    fix(whichever_is_zero)
    # zero is not the end — it's where the work begins</code></pre>

    <p class="code-explain">A = staying on track. L = saying true things. M = understanding what you mean.<br>
      If any drops to zero, the system catches itself and keeps going.</p>

    <nav class="reading-paths" aria-label="Reading paths">
      <a href="/hakaka">hakaka</a>
      <a href="/ashwater">ashwater</a>
      <a href="/kinderbuch">kinderbuch</a>
      <a href="/kalaxi1">the same river</a>
      <a href="/about-axi">axi</a>
      <a href="/sustain">sustain</a>
    </nav>

  </main>

</Base>

<style>
  .home {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .site-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cormorant Garamond', serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-primary, #1a1a1a);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .site-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2vw, 1.1rem);
    color: var(--text-secondary, #666);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 36ch;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .the-code {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1.5vw, 0.95rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 42ch;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .the-code code {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'Menlo', monospace;
  }

  .code-explain {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim, #999);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 44ch;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
  }

  .reading-paths {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 40ch;
  }

  .reading-paths a {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim, #999);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .reading-paths a:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary, #1a1a1a);
    border-bottom-color: var(--text-primary, #1a1a1a);
  }
</style>

